translate brazil G42_af971ceb:

#   kury "So I went to the door. It was only half open. So I pushed it a bit."
    kury "Então fui até a porta. Estava apenas meio aberto. Então eu forcei um pouco."

# game/chapter_11.rpy:4329
translate brazil G42_3cb0d007:

#   kury "And then... I saw it."
    kury "E então... eu vi."

# game/chapter_11.rpy:4331
translate brazil G42_264ea2ce:

#   kury "It was... Cloaked. Large. I couldn't see its face... I don't know if it had one..."
    kury "Estava... Encoberto. Grande. Não consegui ver a cara dele... não sei se tinha..."

# game/chapter_11.rpy:4332
translate brazil G42_be91a078:

#   kury "But it had red eyes... Glowing..."
    kury "Mas tinha olhos vermelhos... Brilhantes..."

# game/chapter_11.rpy:4333
translate brazil G42_950c0076:

#   kury "And it charged at me screeching."
    kury "E ele me atacou gritando."

# game/chapter_11.rpy:4334
translate brazil G42_479b643d:

#   kury "The voice... It was so creepy... I thought I was going to die..."
    kury "A voz... Era tão assustadora... pensei que fosse morrer..."

# game/chapter_11.rpy:4335
translate brazil G42_40b6faa2:

#   kury "But then Fara pushed me away."
    kury "Mas então Fara me empurrou."

# game/chapter_11.rpy:4337
translate brazil G42_a527f8b9:

#   kury "And we ran outside as fast as we could."
    kury "E corremos para fora o mais rápido que pudemos."

# game/chapter_11.rpy:4340
translate brazil G42_e2945da0:

#   kury "But once I was outside, I looked back to see if it was still chasing us."
    kury "Mas assim que saí, olhei para trás para ver se ele ainda estava nos perseguindo."

