#   kury "I was trembling in fear... But I mustered the courage to go in..."
    kury "Eu estava tremendo de medo... Mas reuni coragem para entrar..."

# game/chapter_11.rpy:4348
translate brazil G42_1e229e97:

#   kury "I walked as slowly and quietly as I could..."
    kury "Caminhei o mais devagar e silenciosamente que pude..."

# game/chapter_11.rpy:4349
translate brazil G42_ff8a2199:

#   kury "Looking for the hallway where I coulda lost Fara..."
    kury "Procurando o corredor onde eu poderia ter perdido Fara..."

# game/chapter_11.rpy:4350
translate brazil G42_9bf46b7d:

#   kury "And then..."
    kury "E então..."

# game/chapter_11.rpy:4351
translate brazil G42_2a3b11e4:

#   kury "I found it..."
    kury "eu achei..."

